## Data endpoints

Public files that other sites, notebooks or agents may fetch. A project that lists a URL
here keeps it answering, with `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` set. A path is relative to the
site URL, even with a leading `/`, so an app served under `/app/` lists `/data/x.json` for
`/app/data/x.json`; give a file on another host as a full `https://` URL. Delete the table
if the project serves no data.

